---
import CaseStudyLayout from '../../layouts/CaseStudyLayout.astro';
---

<CaseStudyLayout
  title="Dexcom — Team Building"
  summary="Building and leading an EU-based design studio while aligning execution and decision-making across EU and US leadership."
  role="Design Leadership"
  timeline="2024—Present"
  platform="Web & Mobile"
>
  <section class="fade-in group border-t border-white/5 pt-12" style="animation-delay: 0.2s;">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 md:gap-24">
      <div class="md:w-48 flex-shrink-0 pt-1">
        <span class="text-xs font-medium text-[#52525B] uppercase tracking-wider">Overview</span>
      </div>
      <div class="w-full space-y-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium text-[#EDEDED] tracking-tight">Executive summary</h2>
        <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-[#A1A1AA] max-w-3xl">
          Established a regional product design studio, aligned governance with US teams, and strengthened execution through hiring, processes, and capability building.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-[16px] text-[#A1A1AA]">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#EDEDED] mt-2"></span>
            <span>Scaled team to 10 designers across multiple product areas</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#EDEDED] mt-2"></span>
            <span>Introduced cross-regional intake, prioritization, and design QA</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <div class="pt-4">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1581291518633-83b4ebd1d83e?w=2400&q=80" alt="Design Process" class="w-full rounded bg-[#111] border border-white/10 transition-all duration-700 hover:border-white/20" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="fade-in group border-t border-white/5 pt-12" style="animation-delay: 0.3s;">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 md:gap-24">
      <div class="md:w-48 flex-shrink-0 pt-1"><span class="text-xs font-medium text-[#52525B] uppercase tracking-wider">Situation</span></div>
      <div class="w-full space-y-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium text-[#EDEDED] tracking-tight">Context & problem</h2>
        <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-[#A1A1AA] max-w-3xl">
          Distributed decision-making created misalignment between regions. Product areas needed clearer ownership and reliable execution patterns within a regulated environment.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="fade-in group border-t border-white/5 pt-12" style="animation-delay: 0.4s;">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 md:gap-24">
      <div class="md:w-48 flex-shrink-0 pt-1"><span class="text-xs font-medium text-[#52525B] uppercase tracking-wider">Action</span></div>
      <div class="w-full space-y-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium text-[#EDEDED] tracking-tight">Process & solution</h2>
        <ol class="space-y-4 text-[16px] text-[#A1A1AA] list-decimal pl-5 marker:text-[#EDEDED]">
          <li><span class="text-[#EDEDED] font-medium">Org foundations.</span> Role clarity, rituals, and collaboration guidelines.</li>
          <li><span class="text-[#EDEDED] font-medium">Design QA.</span> Introduced formal sign-off for high-risk releases.</li>
          <li><span class="text-[#EDEDED] font-medium">Hiring.</span> Built a balanced team across research, systems, and product design.</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="fade-in group border-t border-white/5 pt-12" style="animation-delay: 0.5s;">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 md:gap-24">
      <div class="md:w-48 flex-shrink-0 pt-1"><span class="text-xs font-medium text-[#52525B] uppercase tracking-wider">Result</span></div>
      <div class="w-full space-y-8">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium text-[#EDEDED] tracking-tight">Outcome & impact</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-3 text-[16px] text-[#A1A1AA]">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#EDEDED]"></span><span>Improved cross-regional delivery predictability</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#EDEDED]"></span><span>Higher quality releases through QA and design system adoption</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</CaseStudyLayout>

